    <string name="set_about">About</string>
    <string name="set_about_body">whatsBird runs fully offline on device. It never uploads photos. It only recognises the species it was trained on; birds outside that list may show as “Bird” or occasionally be mislabelled as a listed species — treat results as a hint, not ground truth.</string>
